  "description": "Transfiguration holds a body in an unresolved state of becoming. \n\nLike an exoskeleton at the moment of ecdysis, its enclosing structure must eventually give way. \nRupture becomes the condition of emergence, as what once contained and defined the body becomes the condition of its emergence.\n\nModelled in Zbrush and Maya, rendered in Arnold.",
